        "description": "A girl who lives in Nanto Street, Kowloon. She works part-time in various shops including a shoe shop and cinema, and uses the money she earns to buy more frilly and ribbon covered clothes for her collection. She frequently runs into [Reiko](https://anilist.co/character/160725/Reiko-Kujirai) and [Hajime](https://anilist.co/character/160726/Hajime-Kudou) around the city. \n\n~!Later revealed to be biologically male, Xiaohei eventually moves to Hong Kong after Kowloon’s demolition, quits cross-dressing, and undertakes covert work under orders from [Miyuki Hebinuma](https://anilist.co/character/205053/Hebinuma-Miyuki)’s father.!~",
